{"Title":"An Act updating the accuracy of membership to the state advisory council on early education and care","BillNumber":"H4816","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"TJW1","Name":"Thomas P. Walsh","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TJW1","ResponseDate":"2024-07-01T09:52:37.79"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"TJW1","Name":"Thomas P. Walsh","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TJW1","ResponseDate":"2024-07-01T09:52:37.79"},{"Id":"AHP1","Name":"Alice Hanlon Peisch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AHP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T13:35:56.0833333"},{"Id":"RBB1","Name":"Ruth B. Balser","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RBB1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-12T14:02:18.3833333"},{"Id":"T_V1","Name":"Tommy Vitolo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_V1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-12T14:02:18.3833333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4816/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Substituted, on motion of Mr. Walsh of Peabody, for a bill with the same title (House No. 551). July 1, 2024.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 3A of Chapter 15D of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 23, the words “Parents Alliance for Catholic Education” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- Massachusetts Council for American Private Education.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 3A of said chapter 15D, as so appearing, is hereby further amended by striking out, in line 26, the words “Bureau of Jewish Education” and inserting in place thereof the following words: Combined Jewish Philanthropies.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[],"Amendments":[]}